{
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "meeting_at_a_glance",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Sam Reyes and Priya Nair from Northwind Advisory are meeting with Marcus Ellery and Ingrid Solheim of Halden Pay to review the merchant onboarding redesign timeline, risk workstream, and regulator deadline.",
          "citations": [
            "cal:M1"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "client_snapshot",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Halden Pay is engaged for a merchant onboarding redesign including an audit of the flow, evaluation of risk-scoring logic, and defining portal requirements.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The total professional fee for the project is £62,000.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fees are payable in three instalments: £22,000 upon project commencement, £20,000 upon delivery of the risk-scoring review, and £20,000 upon completion of the portal requirements documentation.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The target go-live date for the new merchant onboarding flow is 14 April 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The deadline for the Payments Oversight Authority safeguarding attestation is 31 March 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E49"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The total change-request budget for the remainder of the project phase is capped at £15,000.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D19"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Internal data from 10 December 2025 shows 31% of prospective merchants drop out during the initial application process.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As of 20 January 2026, the chargeback rate fell from 0.92% to 0.61% over the previous three-month window.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D9"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "recent_news",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "On 29 January 2026, Halden Pay reported a total processed volume of €4.1bn for 2025, a 22% increase over the prior year.",
          "citations": [
            "news:N9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 24 February 2026, Halden Pay introduced instant payout capabilities for its merchant network in Ireland.",
          "citations": [
            "news:N22"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "where_we_left_off",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "On 5 February 2026, Ingrid Solheim confirmed the decision to use VeriTrace for KYC as it verified merchants 38% faster than IdentiQ in tests.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E37"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 20 February 2026, Marcus Ellery stated the board expects the new onboarding flow to be live on 14 April with no room for movement.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E47"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 25 February 2026, the steering committee approved initial wireframes for the automated verification module and paused the Spanish expansion until Q3.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D19"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 27 February 2026, Priya Nair sent an invoice for £20,000, representing the second of three instalments.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E55"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 6 March 2026, Priya Nair noted that formal sign-off on the attestation is required before moving to the next project phase.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E66"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 6 March 2026, Priya Nair informed Sam Reyes that the client must be pinned down on the final go-live date during the Wednesday checkpoint.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E66"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "open_items",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Ingrid Solheim promised on 18 February 2026 to deliver the updated KYC risk-scoring matrix by 27 February, but stated on 6 March 2026 she had not yet sent it.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E46",
            "chat:C28"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marcus Ellery emphasized on 23 February 2026 that the 31 March 2026 deadline for the Payments Oversight Authority safeguarding attestation cannot slip.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E49"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 25 February 2026, Northwind Advisory committed to investigating alternative integration methods for the third-party KYC validation service.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D19"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The project manager was tasked on 25 February 2026 with prioritising the backlog to stay within the £15,000 change-request budget.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D19"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sam Reyes requested an ETA for the risk-scoring matrix from Ingrid Solheim on 4 March 2026 to review logic before a presentation.",
          "citations": [
            "chat:C25"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "attendees",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Sam Reyes is a Senior Consultant at Northwind Advisory who serves as the day-to-day lead on all three engagements.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Priya Nair is an Engagement Manager at Northwind Advisory who leads the engagement and owns contracts and invoicing.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marcus Ellery is the Chief Financial Officer at Halden Pay and the budget owner who prefers fixed dates and capped costs.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingrid Solheim is the Head of Risk at Halden Pay, responsible for KYC and risk scoring, and is currently stretched thin by audit preparation.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P6"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talking_points_and_risks",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Sources disagree on the go-live date: Marcus Ellery stated on 20 February 2026 that the board expects the flow to be live on 14 April.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E47"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The other source says engineering reported on 26 February 2026 that 28 April is the realistic ship date and 14 April is not happening.",
          "citations": [
            "chat:C22"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The 31 March 2026 deadline for the Payments Oversight Authority safeguarding attestation is at risk as formal sign-off is still required.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E49",
            "email:E66"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The delivery of the KYC risk-scoring matrix is overdue from the promised 27 February date, impacting the logic review and presentation.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E46",
            "chat:C25",
            "chat:C28"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Progress may be impacted by limited stakeholder availability from the legal department due to an internal audit.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Friction points identified in the multi-factor authentication flow on 11 February 2026 require further iteration.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D15"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
